WEBVTT

00:06:58.956 --> 00:07:02.293
from that original
Fortune 500 list in 1955

00:07:02.334 --> 00:07:05.254
that's still hanging out near the top.

00:07:05.713 --> 00:07:09.216
And starting a car company
is moderately nuts.

00:07:09.258 --> 00:07:10.843
Really, at any time.

00:07:10.885 --> 00:07:12.428
It's a pretty impressive thing

00:07:12.428 --> 00:07:15.890
that they took what was once
a ridiculous luxury

00:07:15.931 --> 00:07:19.268
and turned it into an everyday necessity.

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.979
But then, government got used to GM,

00:07:21.979 --> 00:07:23.814
GM got used to governments.

00:07:23.856 --> 00:07:30.029
And by 1981, government is using
the power of eminent domain